  m_text: 'Hello, I''ll tell you about the premise of this game. The idea is that
    there''s treasure somewhere, but before you can get it, you have to kill enemies
    in the game. When you kill enemies, you earn coins :)


    There''s a surprise
    waiting for you at the end.

    I wish you all the best.

'
